{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/186844-recruitment-mage-the-awakening-play-by-post","id":186844,"title":"[Recruitment] Mage: The Awakening - Play by Post","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-02T23:00:14-07:00","id":186844,"title":"[Recruitment] Mage: The Awakening - Play by Post","content":"Hello all,<br /> <br /> I'm starting a <i>Mage </i>chronicle titled <b>The Division Bell </b>on RPoL.net. I'm in search of a small group of players, preferably 3 to 4, for what I hope will be an extended, character-driven chronicle of psychological horror, tackling themes of identity and deception among the Awakened of contemporary Detroit.<br /> <br /> If you are interested, please follow the link below, read through the introductory materials, and submit a request to join. Looking forward to a great game with you!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.rpol.net/game.cgi?gi=60475&amp;date=1404366162\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://www.rpol.net/images/banner-light.gif\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.rpol.net/game.cgi?gi=60475&amp;date=1404366162\" target=\"_blank\"> I can't find your game! </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.rpol.net/game.cgi?gi=60475&amp;date=1404366162\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.rpol.net/game.cgi?gi=60475&amp;date=1404366162 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> RolePlay onLine is a custom made, free web based message board community that anyone can create a game on. It supports internal private messages, groups and multiple aliases, character sheets and descriptions, plus a game map, intro and url. Your email address is kept private and is only used for verification. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/361-brighthand","name":"Brighthand","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T05:33:55-07:00","id":186983,"title":"","content":"I'm interested in playing. Couple snags though, first being that I don't have the core book, and my credit card doesn't seem to wanna work right now, so I can't buy it at the moment. I'm looking into that, so I'll update ya when I do get the book. The second one is my lack of intimate knowledge for the city of Detroit. I just don't feel right when writing a story about things that I don't know, especially for a place like Detroit, which has a history of several touchy subjects.<br /> <br /> That said, I still love the idea of the game and if the snags aren't too much for you, I'll gladly join. I have yet to create a character, but a few ideas are swirling around. I'm thinking of having a native who's very poor and desperate for change. Past that, I've got nothing, not even a name. Main detriment is the aforementioned second snag, so maybe a bit of research and bouncing a few ideas with you(I'm guessing you're setting this in Detroit because you're familiar with it) will help with that. Once I get a solid idea of the character though, I'll send an official request.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T08:25:38-07:00","id":187107,"title":"","content":"I've never been within fifty miles of Detroit, actually. It just struck me as a good backdrop for some of the concepts I had in mind. I'd be happy to discuss any character ideas with you!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/361-brighthand","name":"Brighthand","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T12:22:58-07:00","id":187308,"title":"","content":"I just stared reading on MtAw so I would love to join. I do not know Detroit either but I do not think that should limit us that much. The character could just moved into the city.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/744-korusef","name":"Korusef","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar744_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"510"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T18:14:07-07:00","id":187555,"title":"","content":"I'm so in, especially if you let me use my custom legacy <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> (That's a joke, I actually plan to play something completely different).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":2757,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","user":"proindrakenzol","date":". 07-03-2014, 09:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-05T18:32:39-07:00","id":189028,"title":"","content":"I would be interested in this. I am mainly a werewolf and vampire player but if always looking to explore more. I have all the books and have two concepts ready to go. One is an amatuer MMA fighter (going into perfected adept) the other is a spiritual detective of sorts looking for the root of the decay of the city (thinking of a Thrice-Great). Couple of questions. Any changes to character creation and are you planning on using GMC updates when available?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2070-daway","name":"DaWay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-07T03:19:38-07:00","id":190082,"title":"","content":"Alright, so I have the Mage corebook and reading the hell out of it(really appreciate the sheer amount of love and dedication that went into it). I've already come up with a solid character, which I've already put up in my request to join, so you should be able to see it. If you can't, and for everyone else anyways, here's his sheet: <a href=\"http://www.myth-weavers.com/sheetview.php?sheetid=947363\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.myth-weavers.com/sheetvie...sheetid=947363</a><br /> <br /> I'd really appreciate some feedback, especially if he's appropriate as a character or not. I'll be working on his mage template for now, Path/Order being Obrimos/Adamantine Arrow if you're curious.","